{title: Mai Dekhu Teri Photo}
{artist: Karan Sehmbi}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
Main dekha teri [Cm]photo,        Sau so [G#]baar kude
Main dekhun teri [A#]photo,        Sau sau [Gm]baar kude
Ke uthdey [Cm]tuffaan seene wich,        Sau sau [G#]baar kude
Tu sapne me [Cm]aa he jaati hai [G#],        Tu neend [A#]uda he jaati hai [Gm]
Tu sapne me [Cm]aa he jaati hai,        Tu neend udaa [G#]he jaati hai
Tu mil ekk [A#]baar kude,        Me dekhun teri [Cm]foto
100-100 [G#]baar kude,        Ke uthde [Cm]toofaan seene vich
100-100 [G#]baar kude,        Me dekhu teri foto [A#]
[Cm]Diwaana tune kr dia,        Aise tere bin abb rh [G#]na saku
[A#]Dilki baat tujhe akar me,        [Cm]Keh naa saku
Meri good [Cm]morning tu hai,        Meri good [G#]night bi tu
Ye duniyaa wrong [A#]lge,        Meri liye right [Gm]bhi tu
Tu ban meri [Cm]raani kude [G#],        Deewaana nir [A#]maaan kude [Gm]
Tu kr ehshaan [Cm]kude,        Main dekhun teri [Cm]photo
Sau sau [G#]baar kude,        Ke uthde [Cm]toofaan seene vich
Sau sau [G#]baar kude,        Main dekhun teri [A#]photo [Cm]
Zara [Cm]tasveer se tu,        Nikal ke [G#]saamne aa
Teriyan [A#]sochan de vich,        Main pagal [Gm]ho gaya
Ni ik din [Cm]mel hona [A#],        Jo rab da [Cm]khel hona [A#]
Tu rahe mere [A#]naal kudde
